255
00:15:10,664 --> 00:15:15,264
But it does not explain why Texas
swung harder than almost anywhere else.

256
00:15:15,612 --> 00:15:17,895
So listen to Texas Republicans themselves.

257
00:15:18,007 --> 00:15:21,370
The morning after, the head of
the Texas Young Republicans and

258
